<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UBS on Lousiana Land, Burlington.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UBS on Lousiana Land, Burlington.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Michael Barbis downgraded both Louisiana Land and Exploration Co and Burlington Resources Inc to hold from buy following the proposed merger between the two companies.</p>
<p>-- said in report &quot;strategically we like the fit of the Burlington/Louisiana Land merger.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said Burlington increases exposure to oil.</p>
<p>-- said deal was &quot;an expensive price to pay for LLX. Burlington has obviously factored in a substantial amount of upside associated with LLX's vast Gulf of Mexico acreage position.&quot;</p>
</text>
